{"term": {"label": "道", "occurrences": 6, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii", "title": "公孫丑下", "description": "孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "一", "id": "一"}, {"form": "前", "id": "前"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "問", "id": "問"}, {"form": "寡", "id": "寡"}, {"form": "或", "id": "或"}, {"form": "敢", "id": "敢"}, {"form": "時", "id": "時"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "請", "id": "請"}, {"form": "識", "id": "識"}, {"form": "過", "id": "過"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.2300144001592104, "source": "寡", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.9231615807191558, "source": "寡", "target": "識"}, {"weight": 1.488077055429833, "source": "前", "target": "敢"}, {"weight": 0.5389965007326869, "source": "前", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.8935421635379974, "source": "前", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.7393914837107392, "source": "前", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 2.0476928433652555, "source": "敢", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.45315795147342, "source": "敢", "target": "請"}, {"weight": 0.9772514316638422, "source": "受", "target": "古"}, {"weight": 1.200394982978052, "source": "受", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.2300144001592104, "source": "古", "target": "用"}, {"weight": 2.517696472610991, "source": "古", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.700018029404946, "source": "古", "target": "過"}, {"weight": 2.2300144001592104, "source": "古", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.3353749158170367, "source": "或", "target": "一"}, {"weight": 2.740840023925201, "source": "或", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.028522096376982, "source": "或", "target": "問"}, {"weight": 2.9231615807191558, "source": "君子", "target": "過"}, {"weight": 1.5040773967762742, "source": "用", "target": 